WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.745
Come on, Blackie, show me what you got!

2
00:00:03.045 --> 00:00:04.891
I'm betting a barrel of mead on the black one!

3
00:00:05.191 --> 00:00:07.908
Break them, Black! Come on, fight!

4
00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:10.319
Fight, you fish heads!

5
00:00:10.619 --> 00:00:13.976
Are the Whites turning pale with fright? Haha!

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.500
The fun is over! I said, that's enough! Disperse. Or should I explain it some other way?
